    "own_line": true,
    "norm": "Verifies that nesting three {@link FilterListIterator}s composes their predicates. <p> The source list is {@code [0, 1, ..., 19]}. Wrapping it in a \"divisible by three\" filter, then an \"even\" filter, then a pass-through (\"always true\") filter should yield exactly the multiples of six, since a number divisible by both 3 and 2 is divisible by 6. The result is compared element-by-element (in both directions) against a plain {@link ListIterator} over the expected multiples of six."
   },
